      "message": "I am wary of having a wakelock held for an arbitrary amount of time as you are doing. There are multiple point which I would like to address:\n\n1. how is the 10s determined ? Idealistically on what even would you release the wakelock ? \n2. there is no traceability / accountability for the wakelock here; either through tracepoints or logs. It is going to make inspecting the logic very difficult in the future.",
